--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository contains NO third-party binaries. (The optional `-with-BepInEx` release
archive does redistribute BepInEx unmodified; it carries all four third-party license texts
and a THIRD-PARTY.md manifest.) It contains only original source code, build scripts and
documentation. The following components are required at build or run time and must be
obtained by the user from their original sources:

  BepInEx 5 (LGPL-2.1)                 https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx
    Mod loader. Bundles HarmonyX and MonoMod. Not redistributed here; the
    README links to the official release.

  HarmonyX (MIT)                       https://github.com/BepInEx/HarmonyX
    Runtime patching library, shipped inside BepInEx as 0Harmony.dll.

  Mono.Cecil (MIT)                     https://github.com/jbevain/cecil
    Used only during research to read the game's IL. Not required to build
    or run this mod.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Not included, and deliberately so
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  Frankenstein: Beyond the Time and its assemblies are property of The Dust.
  No game files are redistributed, and none are modified: the fix is a BepInEx
  plugin that patches the running game in memory. It is compiled against the
  user's own installed copy.

  SteamVR, OpenVR and the Oasis Driver for Windows Mixed Reality are neither
  redistributed nor modified.

